Base Deployment Fork

GIVEN the six-chain fork topology is deployed
  WHEN the active fork is Base
    THEN the parent deployment is configured with Base mainnet addresses
    AND the parent vault is deployed as a UUPS proxy with the upgrader role granted
    AND the share owner is initialized to the upgrader address
    AND the parent vault supports the known Yieldcoin protocol IDs
    AND the parent vault leaves its own chain selector unregistered
    AND the parent vault trusts each child vault by chain selector
